        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "比较 + gradable predicate",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "比较 before an adjective gives a relative, moderate evaluation without naming a comparison standard. It does not itself mean more than a named person.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "这里比较安静。",
                "pinyin": "zhèlǐ bǐjiào ānjìng 。",
                "meaning": "It is relatively quiet here.",
                "audio": "2d45860c225276e709e17a6887cef7802cb7c34c580edaed531c5ff718c5f9c9"
              },
              {
                "text": "这本书比较难。",
                "pinyin": "zhè běn shū bǐjiào nán 。",
